    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "jmpmtev",
      "content": "• Rigveda is the oldest Veda"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Indra (Purandhara) is the most praised deity in the Rigveda with 250 hymns dedicated to him.",
        "The famous Battle of Ten Kings (Dasrajan War) was fought on the banks of the Parushni (Ravi) river.",
        "Women had access to assemblies like Sabha and Vidatha in the Early Vedic Period, but lost this right in the Later Vedic Period.",
        "Iron was introduced in the Later Vedic period and was referred to as 'Shyama Ayas' or 'Krishna Ayas'."
      ],
      "id": "6xvi961"
    },
